    "answer": {
      "short": "$712\\,842$",
      "worked": "Choose 2 of the 13 hearts and 3 of the 39 non-hearts.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\binom{13}{2}\\binom{39}{3}\\\\N&=78\\times9139\\\\N&=712\\,842.\\end{align*}$$",
